    "manual": "Made for manual play: read the Influence and build the team for it.",
    "influence_info": "The Influence is the constellation's mechanic, the same in all three explorations. It lasts the whole fight, like a passive that Oblivion can't silence, and it says who it applies to: the foes, only the guardian, your team or everyone.",
    "influence_text": {
      "ursa_minor": "Polaris never moves: the guardian opens its wave by acting before anyone. Bring HP and Defense to take the opening blow, then answer.",
      "camelopardalis": "From up high, the Giraffe sees every weak spot: every foe starts its wave with Foresight, so its first hit is critical. Steal the buff or soak that first hit with HP.",
      "auriga": "The Charioteer harnesses the foes to his chariot: they all start each wave with Speed Up. Push their Impetus back, apply Speed Down or be faster still.",
      "lynx": "The Lynx hunts in the dark: every foe starts its wave Hidden and can't be targeted by single attacks. Area damage opens the wave.",
      "ursa_major": "The Great Bear has the thickest hide in the sky: the guardian takes less damage from every hit. Affliction and Bomb get through the hide; weak hits don't.",
      "leo_minor": "The cub already roars: when the guardian's wave starts, your team may get Attack Down. Resistance blocks the roar, and Cleanse clears it.",
      "canes_venatici": "The Hunting Dogs never hunt alone: after acting, a foe may call a packmate to strike the same target. Protect whoever is targeted and bring the pack down fast.",
      "coma_berenices": "Berenice offered her hair to the gods: each foe that falls shields the others. Bring the wave down together with area damage.",
      "bootes": "The Herdsman drives his flock: at the start of each of his turns, the foes gain Impetus. Take the guardian down first.",
      "corona_borealis": "The crown protects its wearer: the guardian starts its wave with Immunity and Defense Up. Steal the buffs or wait them out before spending your big skills.",
      "hercules": "What doesn't fell Hercules makes him stronger: every harmful effect the guardian receives gives it Attack Up. Win on damage, without piling effects on it.",
      "lyra": "Orpheus's lyre lulls even beasts: enemy hits may put your monsters to Sleep. Sleepers wake when hit; Immunity and Cleanse help.",
      "vulpecula": "The Fox takes whatever it finds: enemy hits may steal a buff from your team. Don't rely on long buffs.",
      "cygnus": "The Swan sweeps aside with its wings: every foe may dodge each hit. Many hits and area damage make up for the misses.",
      "draco": "Draco has guarded the pole for ages: at the start of each turn, the guardian may breathe on your whole team. Bring healing and Shields to outlast the breath.",
      "cepheus": "King Cepheus silences the court: at the start of each wave, your team may be Silenced (basic skill only). Resistance and Cleanse restore their voices.",
      "lacerta": "The Lizard regrows its tail: the guardian heals at the start of each of its turns. Gather your damage and finish it at once, or stop the healing with Wound.",
      "cassiopeia": "The queen can't bear to be touched: every foe reflects part of the damage it takes back at the attacker. Healing, drain and HP withstand the mirror.",
      "triangulum": "Three points, three blessings: foes start each wave with Shield, Attack Up and Defense Up. Steal the buffs or break their Defense.",
      "perseus": "Perseus raises Medusa's head: after acting, the guardian may petrify (stun) its target. Immunity, Resistance and Cleanse break the stone.",
      "andromeda": "Andromeda was chained to the rock, and the jailer guards the chain: each wave opens with Speed Down on your team, and the guardian's hits may stun. Resistance and Immunity loosen the chains.",
      "pisces": "The Fishes swim in healing waters: foes start each wave with Blessing. Bring them down quickly, before the water heals, or steal the Blessing.",
      "cetus": "The Sea Monster drags you down: on each foe's turn, your team may lose Impetus. High Speed and Impetus boosters beat the undertow.",
      "aries": "The Golden Ram charges head first: the guardian starts its wave ahead and each of its hits knocks the target back on the bar. Speed and Impetus boosters make up for it.",
      "taurus": "The more the Bull is struck, the harder it charges: whoever hits the guardian gives it Attack Up and Impetus. A few strong hits, Attack Down and stuns hold the fury.",
      "orion": "Orion marks his prey: enemy hits may apply Curse, and the guardian hits marked targets much harder. Cleanse and Immunity erase the mark.",
      "lepus": "The Hare runs for it: the foe with the least HP gets much faster, and the guardian starts its wave ahead. Area damage leaves no one behind.",
      "canis_major": "Sirius's heat scorches both sides: at the start of each turn, anyone may catch Affliction. Cleanse and healing let your team outlast theirs.",
      "monoceros": "The Unicorn's horn cleanses any harm: at the start of each turn, a foe may remove a harmful effect from an ally. Win on damage, not on effects.",
      "gemini": "The twins are never apart: when a foe falls, the others heal and gain Attack Up. Bring both twins low together and finish them with area damage.",
      "canis_minor": "The Lesser Dog guards the door: the guardian starts its wave taunting your team, with Defense Up. Resistance and Cleanse free your targeting; Defense Break opens it up.",
      "cancer": "The Crab shuts itself in its shell: every foe starts its wave with Defense Up and a Shield. Defense Break, defense-ignoring damage and stealing buffs crack the carapace.",
      "leo": "The Nemean Lion opens its wave with a roar (Attack Down and Speed Down on your team) and hits the wounded harder. Resistance, Cleanse and healing keep your team standing.",
      "sextans": "The Sextant measures every blow: every foe starts its wave with Crit Resist. Steady damage, Affliction and Bomb are worth more than crits here.",
      "hydra": "Cut off one of the Hydra's heads and another grows: every foe comes back once after falling. Save damage for the second time.",
      "crater": "Whoever drinks from the Cup cannot heal: enemy hits may apply Wound. Shields and Immunity protect better than healing.",
      "corvus": "The Crow brings oblivion: enemy hits may apply Oblivion (passives stop working), and the guardian hits the forgetful harder. Build a team that doesn't rely on passives.",
      "virgo": "The Maiden reaps and shares: at the start of each turn, the guardian heals the foes and cleanses the most wounded. Take the guardian down first.",
      "libra": "The Scales even everything out: at the start of each turn, each side shares its HP evenly. Area damage works; focusing one target doesn't. Your tank holds the frail ones' HP.",
      "serpens": "The Serpent poisons with every bite: enemy hits may apply Affliction. Cleanse, Immunity and healing beat the venom.",
      "ophiuchus": "The Serpent Bearer brings back the dead: on its wave, every foe starts with Revive. Steal the effect, wait it out or bring them down twice.",
      "scorpius": "The Scorpion drives its sting: after acting, the guardian may plant a Bomb on its target. Cleanse defuses the Bomb before it explodes.",
      "sagittarius": "The archer always has another arrow: after acting, the guardian shoots the same target again, ignoring part of its Defense. HP, Shields and Aegis hold better than Defense.",
      "scutum": "The Shield nullifies the first blow: every foe starts its wave with Aegis and may raise another on its turn. Multi-hits and area damage strip the Aegis before the big hit.",
      "aquila": "The Eagle carries Zeus's thunderbolts: at the start of each of the guardian's turns, a bolt strikes one of your monsters and may stun it. Spread healing and Resistance across the team.",
      "sagitta": "The Arrow flies straight and first: foes start each wave ahead, with Foresight. Defense and HP endure the first volley.",
      "delphinus": "The Dolphin plays in the waves: every foe that is hit gains Impetus. A few strong blows beat many weak ones.",
      "equuleus": "The Little Horse kicks: enemy hits may knock the target back on the Impetus bar. Speed and Impetus boosters restore the pace.",
      "capricornus": "The Sea-Goat dives when it bleeds: if the guardian is the foe with the least HP, on its turn it heals and gains Immunity. Bring the escort down too, or finish the guardian at once.",
      "aquarius": "The Water Bearer tips the jar: each wave starts by slowing your team, and foes hit the slowed harder. Cleanse and Resistance keep your feet dry.",
      "pegasus": "The winged horse closes the Equatorial sky: the guardian dodges many hits and starts ahead, and the escort starts with Speed Up. Multi-hits and area damage catch what flies.",
      "piscis_austrinus": "Fomalhaut shines alone in the southern sky: each foe that falls enrages the rest. Bring the wave down together, or the guardian before the escort.",
      "sculptor": "The Sculptor breathes life into stone: whoever hits a foe may be stunned. Immunity and Resistance protect; a few strong blows risk less.",
      "fornax": "The Furnace tempers steel: every harmful effect a foe receives gives it Defense Up. Raw damage, or steal the Defense Up afterwards.",
      "eridanus": "The river Eridanus carries off what you built up: each wave starts by draining your team's Impetus, and foes start ahead. High Speed beats the current.",
      "caelum": "The Chisel engraves through defenses: enemy hits may apply Defense Break. Cleanse, Immunity and high HP hold out.",
      "columba": "The Dove calls for peace: at the start of each wave, both sides are Silenced and use only their basic skill. Strong basic attacks and Cleanse break the truce.",
      "puppis": "Argo's Stern carries a close crew: each foe that falls pushes the others forward on the bar. Area damage drops the crew together.",
      "pyxis": "The Compass spins without a north: enemy hits may apply Blind. Cleanse and Immunity restore your bearings.",
      "antlia": "The Air Pump sucks the air out: enemy hits shorten the target's buffs. Keep renewing your buffs, or win without them.",
      "centaurus": "Chiron taught heroes: the foes' skills come back faster. Silence, stuns and fast damage keep the lesson from happening.",
      "lupus": "The Wolf smells blood: foes hit the wounded harder and heal from their damage. Keep HP high and bring the pack down before it recovers.",
      "norma": "The Carpenter's Square measures everyone alike: everyone takes less damage, on both sides, and the fight drags on. Affliction, Bomb and healing decide who lasts.",
      "ara": "At the Altar, blood pays for blood: foes drain much of the damage they deal. Attack Down, Wound and fast damage break the pact.",
      "corona_australis": "The southern crown is broken: at the start of each wave, your team may get Karma and can't receive buffs. Resistance and Cleanse bring the blessings back.",
      "telescopium": "Through the Telescope everyone sees weak spots: both sides start each wave with Crit Up and Foresight. Whoever strikes first, with more Crit Damage, wins.",
      "microscopium": "Under the Microscope, harm spreads: enemy hits lengthen the target's harmful effects and may apply Affliction. Cleansing every turn beats the contagion.",
      "grus": "The Crane keeps watch on one leg: a foe that is hit may gain Counter. Stun before striking, and favor strong single hits.",
      "phoenix": "The southern Phoenix rises once more: the guardian comes back after falling, on top of any passive it already has. Oblivion silences its own passive, not the sky's.",
      "horologium": "In the Clock, everything passes faster: at the start of each turn, the acting unit's effects lose a turn, on both sides. Damage beats effects; stuns barely hold.",
      "reticulum": "The Reticle finds the gap in the armor: foes start with Foresight and hit harder against Shield, Aegis or Defense Up. HP holds better than protection here.",
      "dorado": "The great cloud covers the field: at the start of each wave, both sides may be Blinded. Resistance and Cleanse clear the view.",
      "pictor": "The Painter colors every foe: as the wave starts, each may gain Attack Up, Defense Up and Speed Up. Steal the buffs from whoever got the most.",
      "carina": "Argo's Keel weathers any sea: every foe takes less damage. Affliction and Bomb pierce the hull.",
      "vela": "Argo's Sails fill up: at the start of each of the guardian's turns, the foes gain Impetus and your team loses it. Take the guardian down first.",
      "volans": "The Flying Fish leaps from the water: every foe may dodge, and whoever is hit gains Impetus. Area damage and strong hits catch the school.",
      "mensa": "The Table is solid rock: foes take less damage, and whoever hits them may get Speed Down. A few strong hits and Cleanse.",
      "hydrus": "The Water Snake strikes first: foes start ahead and their hits may apply Affliction. Endure the opening with HP and clear the venom.",
      "tucana": "The Toucan never shuts up: on each foe's turn, one of your monsters may be stunned by the noise. Immunity, Resistance and Cleanse plug your ears.",
      "indus": "The southern hunter waits in the brush: foes start each wave almost ready to act, with Foresight. Defense, HP and Shields withstand the ambush.",
      "pavo": "The Peacock spreads its tail and everyone stares: the guardian starts its wave taunting your team and reflects part of the damage it takes. Healing and Cleanse outlast the show.",
      "octans": "At the south pole of the sky nothing moves: every foe removes a harmful effect for each one it receives. Here, only damage wins.",
      "apus": "The Bird of Paradise preens: foes start with Attack Up and Speed Up, and each buff they receive grants Impetus. Steal their buffs.",
      "triangulum_australe": "The Southern Triangle closes in: after acting, a foe calls two allies to strike the same target. Taunt, Shields and Aegis share the load.",
      "circinus": "The Compass turns and no one is left behind: on each foe's turn, its furthest-behind ally gains Impetus. Strike fast and slow them all at once.",
      "chamaeleon": "The Chameleon blends into the scenery: every foe starts its wave Hidden, and the most wounded one hides and heals on its turn. Area damage finds what vanished.",
      "musca": "The Fly never comes alone: waves full of foes, and their bites may apply Affliction. Area damage and Cleanse.",
      "crux": "The Southern Cross ends the journey: on the guardian's wave every foe starts with Revive; on its turns the guardian heals and cleanses the escort; and each fall enrages the rest. Everything you learned in the sky, at once."
    }
  },

