  "tutorial": {
    "title": "Training",
    "battle_title": "Training fight",
    "continue": "Continue",
    "end_button": "To the Sanctuary",
    "intro": "This is a training fight, Conjurer: nothing is lost here. Your monsters are at the bottom left; the enemies, at the top right.",
    "order": "The column on the left is the turn order: whoever has more Speed acts first. Hold any monster, anywhere in the game, to see its summary.",
    "basic": "{0}'s turn: its skills are at the bottom right. Tap the first one, the basic attack (always ready), then tap the lit enemy.",
    "cooldown": "The other skills are stronger, but once used they wait a few turns: the number on the button says how many are left. Hold a skill to read what it does and when it helps.",
    "elements": "Elements: Water beats Fire, Fire beats Wind and Wind beats Water; Light and Dark beat each other. With the advantage, a hit deals 25% more; against it, 25% less. Pick the team for the enemies of each fight.",
    "element_pick": "Your monsters are Water: strike the Fire enemy, not the Wind one.",
    "stun": "Effects change the fight. {1}'s {0} stuns: the target loses its next turn. Use it now, then tap the enemy.",
    "status_seen": "The symbol next to the enemy is the effect, with the turns it has left. The Effects button, at the bottom left, lists every effect in the fight, and its ? explains each one.",
    "support": "{0} is a support: its basic attack already heals the most wounded ally, and {1} heals everyone. Healing and shields keep the team standing while the others strike.",
